ADDITIONAL TERMS FOR INTELLIGENCE DATA:

The intelligence data contained in this repository (chat logs, screenshots,
infrastructure data, wallet addresses, domain lists, and related artifacts)
is provided for the following authorized purposes:

  * Academic and security research
  * Law enforcement investigations and prosecutions
  * Journalism and public interest reporting
  * Threat intelligence and cyber defense
  * Victim identification and recovery support
  * Anti-fraud and anti-phishing operations

Law enforcement agencies worldwide are explicitly authorized to use, copy,
and distribute any data in this repository for investigative purposes without
restriction.

Misuse of this data for harassment, vigilante action, doxxing of victims,
or any illegal purpose is prohibited and violates the spirit of this license.
